heres of the brain?','hard','2026-09-05 16:33:01','2026-09-05 16:33:01'),(85,2,'Which part of the limbic system is important in motivation and emotions, specifically fear and aggression?','hard','2026-09-05 16:33:01','2026-09-05 16:33:01'),(86,2,'The Hippocampus is primarily responsible for:','medium','2026-09-05 16:33:01','2026-09-05 16:33:01'),(87,2,'Which lobe of the cerebral cortex is responsible for executive functions, planning, and personality?','medium','2026-09-05 16:33:01','2026-09-05 16:33:01'),(88,2,'The Occipital Lobe is primarily responsible for:','easy','2026-09-05 16:33:01','2026-09-05 16:33:01'),(89,2,'Aspects of health that an individual has control over (e.g., diet, smoking) are called:','easy','2026-09-05 16:33:01','2026-09-05 16:33:01'),(90,2,'Age, gender, and genetics are examples of:','easy','2026-09-05 16:33:01','2026-09-05 16:33:01'),(91,2,'What does the \"genogram\" tool primarily help assess?','medium','2026-09-05 16:33:01','2026-09-05 16:33:01'),(92,2,'In the Philippines, the type of obesity commonly affecting adults where fat accumulates abdominally is known as:','medium','2026-09-05 16:33:01','2026-09-05 16:33:01'),(93,2,'Gynoid or pear-shaped obesity involves fat accumulation primarily in the:','hard','2026-09-05 16:33:01','2026-09-05 16:33:01'),(94,2,'According to the National Sleep Foundation, what is the normal state of drowsiness following a meal called?','hard','2026-09-05 16:33:01','2026-09-05 16:33:01'),(95,2,'Lack of sleep can lead to which of the following cognitive impairments?','medium','2026-09-05 16:33:01','2026-09-05 16:33:01'),(96,2,'Which category of psychoactive drugs lowers the body\'s overall energy level and reduces sensitivity to outside stimulation?','easy','2026-09-05 16:33:01','2026-09-05 16:33:01'),(97,2,'Caffeine, nicotine, and cocaine are examples of:','easy','2026-09-05 16:33:01','2026-09-05 16:33:01'),(98,2,'What is the foremost preventable cause of death in the US, and a major health risk globally?','easy'